    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "SOUTHWEST AIRLINES™\nOctober 27, 1991 Flight Schedule\nWERE CELEBRATING\nOUR 20™ ANNIVERSARY.\nTIME FLIES WHEN\nYOU'RE HAVING FUN.",
      "SOUTHWEST AIRLINES\nPacific\nReno/Tahoe\nSacramento\nOakland\nSan Francisco\n• Las Vegas\nBurbank\nLos Angeles\n• Ontario\n(LAX)\nSan Diego\nPhoenix\nNew Service\nMountain\nAlbuquerque\nEl Pasc\nCentral\nEastern\nChicago\n(Midway)\n• Kansas City\nSt. Louis\nTulsa\nOklahoma City\nAmarillo\nLittle Rock\nLubbock\nMidland/\nOdessa\nDallas\n(Love Field)\nAustin\nSan Antonio\nIndianapolis\nNashville P\nBirmingham\n• New Orleans\nCorpus\nChristi•\nHouston\n(Hobby \u0026\nIntercontinental)\nRio Grande Valler\n(Harlingen/South Padre Island)\nIf you fly frequently on Southwest\nAirlines, please send us your name and\naddress and we will place you on our\nmailing list. Mail requests to:\nSouthwest Airlines Schedule List\nPO. Box 650331\nDallas, TX 75265-0331\nAll other correspondence should\nbesentto:\nSouthwest Airlines Co.\nP.O. Box 36611\nDallas, TX 75235-1611\n© 1991 Southwest Airlines\n2005.10б.\n7//"
    ],
